# Deployment and Monitoring

## Container Deployment
- Use [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile) for containerized deployment
- Follow [docker-compose.yaml.example](mdc:docker-compose.yaml.example) for local development
- Support for Home Assistant addon deployment in [addon/](mdc:addon/) and [addon.dev/](mdc:addon.dev/)

## Systemd Integration
- Service file available in [systemd/lxp-bridge.service](mdc:systemd/lxp-bridge.service)
- Configure proper restart policies and dependencies
- Set appropriate user permissions and security contexts

## Health Monitoring
- Health checks run every 60 seconds via the health monitor task
- Monitor channel buffer usage (warnings at 75% capacity)
- Circuit breaker status reporting for MQTT health
- Component status logging for operational visibility

## Logging and Debugging
- Structured logging with timestamps and log levels
- Channel health warnings for buffer overflow detection
- Circuit breaker state changes for failure analysis
- Reconnection attempts and timing information

## Performance Monitoring
- Monitor message throughput and latency
- Track reconnection frequency and success rates
- Monitor memory usage and channel buffer utilization
- Alert on circuit breaker activations
